  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"181\">Mortal Kombat 1 – Nintendo Switch – met origineel hoesje</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"427\">Mortal Kombat 1 is de spectaculaire reboot van de legendarische vechtgame-serie. In deze nieuwe versie heeft Liu Kang het Mortal Kombat-universum opnieuw vormgegeven, met vernieuwde personages, een frisse verhaallijn en spectaculaire gevechten.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"644\">Ontdek een cinematische story mode, intense 1-tegen-1 gevechten en de iconische Fatalities die Mortal Kombat wereldwijd beroemd hebben gemaakt. Dankzij de Nintendo Switch speel je deze game zowel thuis als onderweg.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"729\">De game verkeert in goede staat en is volledig getest, zodat je direct kunt spelen.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"734\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"759\">✅ Game-beschrijving</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"807\">\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"807\">Nieuwe story mode met filmische verhaallijn</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"891\">Vernieuwde en klassieke personages zoals Scorpion, Sub-Zero, Raiden en Liu Kang</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"947\">Iconische Fatalities, Brutalities en speciale moves</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"989\">Lokale multiplayer en online gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1025\">Verbeterde graphics en gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1055\">✅ Productinformatie</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1085\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1112\">Titel: Mortal Kombat 1</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1140\">Genre: Fighting / Actie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1169\">Versie: Fysieke gamecard</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1201\">Inclusief: origineel hoesje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1221\">Multiplayer: Ja</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1226\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1249\">📦 Staat & inhoud</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1272\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1272\">Staat: goede staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1287\">Inclusief:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1318\">Mortal Kombat 1 gamecard</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1341\">Origineel hoesje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1368\">🎯 Geschikt voor</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1396\">Fans van fighting games</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1424\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1424\">Nintendo Switch spelers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1459\">Actie en competitieve gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1492\">💡 <em data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1492\">Direct klaar om te spelen.</em></p>",
